+### Prepending listeners
+
+Use `prependListener` or `prependOnceListener` to register a listener before
+all listeners already registered for an event. When multiple listeners are
+prepended, the newest prepended listener runs first.
+
+```js
+EE.on('event-name', emitted);
+EE.prependListener('event-name', emitted, context);
+EE.prependOnceListener('event-name', emitted, context);
+```
+
 ### Tests and benchmarks
 
 To run tests run `npm test`. To run the benchmarks run `npm run benchmark`.
